    "text": "<p>Match List-I with List-II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>List - I</p>\t\t\t<p>(Elements)</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>List - II</p>\t\t\t<p>(Properties)</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ba</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Organic solvent soluble compounds</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ca</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Outer electronic configuration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Li</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Oxalate insoluble in water</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Na</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Formation of very strong monoacidic base</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
